  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0: Public ScanAsQueryFrame lazy streaming factories for CSV/JSON/Parquet; genuinely async chunk reads for CSV and JSON lazy sources (JsonRecordStreamReader for true streaming JSON array parsing); Parquet row-group predicate pushdown and chunk-based streaming via ParquetLazySource; CsvOptions.SchemaInferenceRows renamed to SchemaInferenceRecords; streaming budget tracker and window overlap buffer support; Streamix reactive streaming scenarios (fault-tolerant, windowed analytics, online AutoDiff learning); NivaraFlux bridge (ToFlux, ToFluxRows, ToNivaraFrameAsync); various streaming and execution fixes. Existing surface: Parquet read/write with compression, Apache Arrow bidirectional conversion, ML.NET DataView integration, CsvHelper-based CSV parsing, lazy data source infrastructure, immutable options with With() builders.",
